3334	Laguna Teak Square End Table	laguna-teak-square-end-table-nc	NC2015ET	The Laguna End Table is 100% solid, plantation grown teak. Whether allowed to weather or maintained to keep it’s natural, warm golden look, it will be a striking addition to your patio setting. It is designed to match the entire Laguna\n\n<p>The Laguna End Table is 100% solid, plantation grown teak. Whether allowed to weather or maintained to keep it’s natural, warm golden look, it will be a striking addition to your patio setting. It is designed to match the entire Laguna collection.</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>A wire wheel is used to distress the reclaimed teak to enhance the grain and provide a rustic finish.</li>\n  <li>Our Plantation Teak products are plantation-grown and harvested from mature trees that are 50-60 years old.</li>\n  <li>This line of teak is part of a replenished forestry program, where a new tree is planted for each one that is harvested.</li>\n  <li>Our Plantation Teak is oven- or air-dried for moisture control.</li>\n  <li>Grade B Teak.</li>\n  <li>You may choose to allow your natural teak to weather to a beautiful silver-gray patina or treat it with an oil or sealer specifically made for natural teak twice a year to preserve the natural wood/teak’s golden finish.</li>\n  <li>Natural teak may be cleaned using a wood cleaner, or lightly sanded with 600 (or higher) grit sandpaper.</li>\n  <li>Leave your natural teak products outside year-round (under a furniture cover when not in use) or store in a COOL, DRY place during the winter to preserve the wood’s moisture.</li>\n</ul>	The Laguna End Table is 100% solid, plantation grown teak. Whether allowed to weather or maintained to keep it’s natural, warm golden look, it will be a striking addition to your patio setting. It is designed to match the entire Laguna	17	46	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	t	f	f	0	t	2026-05-30 23:33:34.358463+00	2026-06-09 22:52:37.657+00	0	\N	\N	\N	fixed	\N	["Laguna", "Teak", "Accent Tables"]	t	\N	\N
